{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\"source\":\"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念——这是一种尚未找到对象、也尚未找到语言的失落。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿保留了愤怒、遗憾、怀念三种可能，屏幕稿却具体化为对某个人的生气和思念，缩窄了原本未确定的情绪。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"昂扬退潮后，又忍不住问：刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信\",\"source\":\"也可以听成：如果换一种感受，这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮。音乐变得流动、含蓄、若有所思，仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确将退潮和自问标为一种可能的听法，屏幕稿取消了这种假设性，把它写成了确定发生的心理活动。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\"source\":\"也可以听成：如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将心理回望及问题浮现都限定为一种可能的听法，屏幕稿则直接断定开头的试探重新提出了这个问题。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e751d9c1-eb0f-4444-ab08-873b02d5389c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T162858290120Z", "elapsed_seconds": 204.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T16:32:23.183977+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ca4b462f44a71c70f376ef4a017dd6e844f3cfe1dda98873cc118dc2a8f7f746", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T162858290120Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e01ecba345a7572a7a48b89d7e593765405475b0cdbe1e7d456ef87dc41e4c4e"}}}
